{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.poster.avif?t=1759172877\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.webm?t=1759172877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.mp4?t=1759172877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machine was given one objective; <strong>make as much jam as possible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Jam's Adjustable Mirrors, Master the art of manipulating rays of sunlight to help the friendly Jam-bot power an elaborate, <i>(and questionably legal)</i>, jam-making operation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level will introduce a unique board of obstacles, testing your logic and skill in strategically placing and rotating many kinds of mirrors, bouncing light beams across levels and even through space and time! <strong>With workshop support and an included level editor, you can also design and share your own levels with others!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The server's hum and key clicks suggest that many minds are working to satisfy the machine. You're not alone, and the abductions persist. You mustn't let anything stop you from growing those sweet, juicy jam plants... lest you're doomed to a life of eternal jamming.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.poster.avif?t=1759172877\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.webm?t=1759172877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.mp4?t=1759172877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890550?t=1759172877","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890550?t=1759172877","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/2531d6b33f87e0f14517d260164d9e23f24a09e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759172877","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/2531d6b33f87e0f14517d260164d9e23f24a09e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759172877","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4050890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.poster.avif?t=1759172877\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.webm?t=1759172877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.mp4?t=1759172877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machine was given one objective; <strong>make as much jam as possible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Jam's Adjustable Mirrors, Master the art of manipulating rays of sunlight to help the friendly Jam-bot power an elaborate, <i>(and questionably legal)</i>, jam-making operation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level will introduce a unique board of obstacles, testing your logic and skill in strategically placing and rotating many kinds of mirrors, bouncing light beams across levels and even through space and time! <strong>With workshop support and an included level editor, you can also design and share your own levels with others!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The server's hum and key clicks suggest that many minds are working to satisfy the machine. You're not alone, and the abductions persist. You mustn't let anything stop you from growing those sweet, juicy jam plants... lest you're doomed to a life of eternal jamming.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.poster.avif?t=1759172877\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.webm?t=1759172877\"